## FLUTTER

# Hooks runner + native-asset cache (covered above by .dart_tool/, but pinned
# explicitly here for clarity when the cache lives outside the project).
.dart_tool/hooks_runner/
.dart_tool/native_assets/

# Local-only Claude Code workspace metadata (machine-specific paths).
# Keep CLAUDE.md (project doc) tracked; ignore the per-session scratch files.
.claude/
